  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNHCR Multi Year Partnership Framework 2022-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The United Nations High Commission for Refugees (UNHCR) Multi Year Partnership Framework 2022-2026 defines and continues the strong relationship with UNHCR including; collaborating on shared priorities to achieve humanitarian outcomes and strengthening the international protection system including through finding durable solutions for refugees. Funding under this initiative represents Australia&apos;s annual core contribution to the UNHCR for its operations and thematic activities to support UNHCR&apos;s mandate to protect refugees as part of the multi-year Partnership Framework. The total value of this investment is $100 million.</narrative>
  </description>
